    "ix.22": "Importance of the expression of different points of view — Deep argument, Transfer debrief",
    "ix.23": "Relationships among people from various backgrounds — Surface jigsaw, Deep sources",
    "ix.24": "The major reform movements of the 19th century — Surface jigsaw & timeline, whole unit",
