    "ix.31": "Chart paper or a projected space for three shared columns: <b>Hunches · Know · Need-to-Know</b> (the KWHL chart).",
    "ix.32": "Vetted primary sources for investigation (district-approved). Suggested public-domain sources — the Declaration of Sentiments, a Frederick Douglass passage, and reform-era documents — are listed in the facilitator guide.",
